Customer gets 2 SMSes; Twilio bills twice." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b71c1c;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="593" y="770" width="513" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="No idempotency in worker" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffebee;strokeColor=#b71c1c;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1146" y="705" width="513" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="Two workers race the same job.
Wrap LLM+send in a DB transaction
